&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This role may require you to complete Non-Police Personnel Vetting (NPPV) security clearance up to level 3.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:150}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
